@startuml
state Start <<start>>
state Confirmed
state PendingConfirmation
state AwaitingPayment
state Canceled <<end>>
state Expired <<end>>
state CheckedIn
state Completed <<end>>
state NoShow <<end>>
state Overbooked <<end>>
state MaintenanceHold
state PaymentFailureHandling
state RefundProcessing

[*] --> Start

Start --> PendingConfirmation : New Reservation

PendingConfirmation --> Canceled : No action for 1h

PendingConfirmation --> AwaitingPayment : Confirmed

AwaitingPayment --> Canceled : No Payment within 24h (Standard)
AwaitingPayment --> Canceled : No Payment within 72h (VIP)

Confirmed --> CheckedIn : Checkin by 2:00 PM arrival date
Confirmed --> NoShow : Missed Checkin + 24h

CheckedIn --> Completed : Checkout

CheckedIn --> ExtensionRequest : Request during InUse state

ExtensionRequest --> CheckedIn : Room available
ExtensionRequest --> NoShow : Room unavailable

Confirmed --> Overbooked : Room unavailable on arrival
Overbooked --> Canceled : No response from guest within 6h

Confirmed --> MaintenanceHold : Room unavailable due to repairs

MaintenanceHold --> Canceled : Reassignment impossible

PaymentFailureHandling --> Canceled : Final Payment Failure

Canceled --> RefundProcessing : Payment error or eligibility

RefundProcessing --> [*]

@enduml